== Overview ==
'''Small Toilet''' is the weakest [[Enemies|enemy]] and appears almost on every map. The toilet is white, and has a [[Normal Toilet]] and [[Large Toilet]] variants. It is also fast. Most units should be able to defeat this. If you want, you can leak this enemy as it only does 10 damage to the base.and is a lazy boy he hires his friends, he gives $3 if you defeat him

