==Trivia==

* It is the first [[Toilets|enemy]] to appear on every map.
* It is currently the weakest enemy in the game.
* It is currently the smallest enemy in the game.
* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Mini_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Mini Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* The Mini Skibidi Toilet first appeared in Episode 4 of the series.
* It shares a model with [[Toilet]] and [[Large Toilet]], the only difference being size.
